Vnum            11111
Name            空腹井緣~
Description
井緣外圍著一圈向內坍陷的封魄柱座，柱座殘光在井腹邊緣慢慢滑落，像在標示最後一段仍屬於外層空腹區的邊界。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       NORTH
ExitVnum        11110
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        11112
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         井緣~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         柱座~
End

End
